    "text": "The power dissipated in the circuit shown in the figure is 30 Watts. The value of $R$ is\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/XUq1uouLQCsNcHbD4ax5-fvjbBx1QkLi8zTLXOamjXw.original.fullsize.png\">",
